- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_enqueue
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Asking for a scope to be looked at. The server alone; the function refuses any other role again itself.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_claim
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Taking the next due job, one per scope, under a lease. The server alone.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_heartbeat
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Renewing a running job's lease. The server alone.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_finish
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Finishing a running job as done, failed or paused. The server alone.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_mark_attempt
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Saying what a running pass has started on. The server alone.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_reclaim
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Failing jobs whose lease ran out and asking for their scopes again. The server alone.
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}{{jobs_table}}_sweep
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: Clearing long-finished jobs and listing what is due. The server alone.
